{"seq":1,"slug":"greedy-optimization","title":"贪心与优化：拟阵恰好刻画「贪心何时最优」","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/matroid-theory/practice/greedy-optimization","wordCount":1479,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"贪心与优化-拟阵恰好刻画-贪心何时最优\">贪心与优化：拟阵恰好刻画「贪心何时最优」</h1><p>贪心算法臭名昭著地不可靠——大多数问题里它给出的是次优解。但在某些问题上它却总能拿到最优，而且拿得干净利落（Kruskal 最小生成树就是范例）。长期以来这被当成「碰巧」。拟阵理论给出了震撼的答案：贪心对所有权重都最优，当且仅当问题的可行集构成拟阵。这一节讲清 Rado-Edmonds 定理及其算法后果，它是全 hub 应用线的支点，承接 <a href=\"../foundations/independence-axioms\">独立性公理</a> 与 <a href=\"../structure/rank-closure\">秩与闭包</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-赋权拟阵上的贪心\">核心概念：赋权拟阵上的贪心</h2><p>设拟阵 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>M</mi><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>E</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"script\">I</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">M=(E,\\mathcal{I})</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathcal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0738em;\">I</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，每个元素 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>e</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">e</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span></span></span></span></span> 有权重 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>w</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>e</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>≥</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">w(e)\\ge 0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≥</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span></span></span></span></span>。目标是找一个独立集 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>I</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi mathvariant=\"script\">I</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">I\\in\\mathcal{I}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7224em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathcal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0738em;\">I</span></span></span></span></span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>e</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi>I</mi></mrow></msub><mi>w</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>e</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sum_{e\\in I}w(e)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0771em;vertical-align:-0.3271em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1786em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4003em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">∈</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3271em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 最大。<strong>贪心算法</strong>极其朴素：</p>\n<ol>\n<li>把元素按权重从大到小排序；</li>\n<li>依次考察每个元素，若加入后仍独立（用独立性 oracle 判定）则加入，否则丢弃；</li>\n<li>遍历完毕，输出所得独立集。</li>\n</ol>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  S[&quot;元素按权重降序排序&quot;] --&gt; L[&quot;遍历每个元素 e&quot;]&#10;  L --&gt; T{&quot;I + e 仍独立?&quot;}&#10;  T --&gt;|是| ADD[&quot;加入 e 到 I&quot;]&#10;  T --&gt;|否| SKIP[&quot;丢弃 e&quot;]&#10;  ADD --&gt; L&#10;  SKIP --&gt; L&#10;  L --&gt; OUT[&quot;输出最大权独立集 I&quot;]&#10;  OUT --&gt; THM[&quot;Rado-Edmonds:&lt;br/&gt;拟阵 &lt;=&gt; 贪心对所有权重最优&quot;]\">graph TD\n  S[\"元素按权重降序排序\"] --&gt; L[\"遍历每个元素 e\"]\n  L --&gt; T{\"I + e 仍独立?\"}\n  T --&gt;|是| ADD[\"加入 e 到 I\"]\n  T --&gt;|否| SKIP[\"丢弃 e\"]\n  ADD --&gt; L\n  SKIP --&gt; L\n  L --&gt; OUT[\"输出最大权独立集 I\"]\n  OUT --&gt; THM[\"Rado-Edmonds:&lt;br/&gt;拟阵 &lt;=&gt; 贪心对所有权重最优\"]</pre><p>下表对比贪心在拟阵与非拟阵上的表现，凸显拟阵结构的必要性：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>可行集结构</th>\n<th>贪心是否总最优</th>\n<th>例子</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>拟阵</td>\n<td>是（对所有权重）</td>\n<td>森林 → 最小/最大生成树</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>一般独立系统</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>0-1 背包、最大权匹配</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>拟阵交（两个拟阵）</td>\n<td>否（需增广算法）</td>\n<td>二部匹配</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"rado-edmonds-定理\">Rado-Edmonds 定理</h2><p>这个「贪心刚好对拟阵有效」不是巧合，而是 Rado（1957）与 Edmonds（1971）证明的<strong>充要</strong>刻画：</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>设 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>E</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"script\">I</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(E,\\mathcal{I})</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathcal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0738em;\">I</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 是满足 (I1)(I2) 的独立系统。则贪心算法对<strong>所有</strong>非负权重都返回最大权极大独立集，当且仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>E</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"script\">I</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(E,\\mathcal{I})</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathcal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0738em;\">I</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 是拟阵（即还满足交换公理 (I3)）。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<p>「当且仅当」是精髓。充分性（拟阵 ⟹ 贪心对）用交换公理 (I3) 做交换论证：任取最优解 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span></span></span></span></span> 与贪心解 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>G</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">G</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">G</span></span></span></span></span>，若某处贪心选得不比最优差，用 (I3) 把 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span></span></span></span></span> 一步步「掰」成 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>G</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">G</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">G</span></span></span></span></span> 而权重不降。必要性（贪心对 ⟹ 拟阵）更妙：若 (I3) 失败，则存在两个不等大的极大独立集，构造一组权重使贪心被诱导进较小的那个，即得次优——反证了非拟阵必有权重让贪心翻车。这条定理把「贪心可用性」彻底还原为一个结构性质。</p>\n<h2 id=\"kruskal-只是一个特例\">Kruskal 只是一个特例</h2><p>最小生成树的 Kruskal 算法，正是「图拟阵上的贪心」（求最小需把权取负或改升序）。理解这一点后，一大批「碰巧贪心对」的算法立刻被统一解释：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>算法/问题</th>\n<th>底层拟阵</th>\n<th>贪心含义</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Kruskal 最小生成树</td>\n<td>图拟阵 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>M</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>G</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">M(G)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">G</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>按权加边、成环则弃</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>最大权线性无关向量组</td>\n<td>向量拟阵</td>\n<td>按权加向量、相关则弃</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>带截止期的单位任务调度</td>\n<td>分拆/横贯拟阵</td>\n<td>按利润排任务、冲突则弃</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>最大权森林</td>\n<td>图拟阵</td>\n<td>同 Kruskal</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>反之，Rado-Edmonds 也是一个<strong>诊断工具</strong>：如果你发现某问题的贪心并不总最优（如 0-1 背包），那几乎必然是因为可行集不构成拟阵——这时该转向别的技术。图上 Kruskal 的具体实现（并查集、排序）见 <a href=\"../../graph-theory/algorithms/mst-topological-sort\">图论 · 最小生成树</a>，本节只讲它为何最优。</p>\n<h2 id=\"复杂度与-oracle-模型\">复杂度与 oracle 模型</h2><p>贪心的运行时间由两部分组成：排序 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(n\\log n)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">lo<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，加上 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span> 次独立性判定。这里独立性判定被抽象为<strong>oracle</strong>——拟阵通常不显式列出指数多的独立集，而是提供一个「给定集合，回答是否独立」的黑盒。以 oracle 调用次数计，贪心是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(n)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 次独立性查询，非常高效。这与 <a href=\"../structure/rank-closure\">秩与闭包</a> 讲的「秩增量恒为 0 或 1、可用加元素看秩是否上升来判独立」直接呼应：每次判定就是一次 oracle 查询。</p>\n<p>oracle 模型是现代拟阵算法复杂度的通用度量。例如 <a href=\"matroid-intersection\">拟阵交</a> 的复杂度就以「独立性 oracle 或秩 oracle 的查询次数」计——2024 年 Ta-Wei Tu 等给出加权拟阵交的首个次二次算法 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>O</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><msup><mi>r</mi><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>4</mn></mrow></msup><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>W</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\tilde{O}(nr^{3/4}\\log W)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1702em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9202em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.6023em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1667em;\"><span class=\"mord\">~</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.888em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">3/4</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">lo<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 查询（来源：arXiv:2212.00508），改进了此前 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>O</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>W</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\tilde{O}(nr\\log W)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1702em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9202em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.6023em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1667em;\"><span class=\"mord\">~</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">lo<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 的界。这些进展都建立在「贪心 + oracle」这一基本范式之上。</p>\n<h2 id=\"从最大权到多面体-拟阵与线性规划\">从最大权到多面体：拟阵与线性规划</h2><p>贪心的最优性还有一个几何影子。拟阵的独立集向量构成的凸包，称为<strong>拟阵多面体</strong>，Edmonds 证明它恰由秩不等式 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>e</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi>S</mi></mrow></msub><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>e</mi></msub><mo>≤</mo><mi>r</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>S</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sum_{e\\in S}x_e \\le r(S)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0771em;vertical-align:-0.3271em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1786em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4003em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">∈</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3271em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>（对所有 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">S</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span></span></span></span></span>）加非负约束刻画。于是「最大权独立集」是一个线性规划，而贪心算法恰好求出它的整数最优顶点——这就是为什么贪心与 LP 松弛在拟阵上无缝对齐（可对比 <a href=\"../operations/representability\">可表示性</a> 里正则拟阵的全幺模性）。这个多面体视角把拟阵接进组合优化的主干，也是拟阵交、子模优化等更难问题的出发点。min-max 对偶的一般思想见 <a href=\"../../optimization-theory/unconstrained-optimization/gradient-descent\">优化理论</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>赋权拟阵上的贪心（降序、能加则加）对所有权重返回最大权独立集。</li>\n<li>Rado-Edmonds 定理：贪心对所有权重最优 ⟺ 可行集是拟阵，是充要刻画，也是诊断工具。</li>\n<li>Kruskal 最小生成树只是图拟阵上贪心的特例；一大批「碰巧对」的贪心由此统一。</li>\n<li>复杂度以 oracle 查询计：贪心是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(n)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 次独立性查询，与秩增量的 0/1 性质呼应。</li>\n<li>拟阵多面体（秩不等式刻画）使贪心与线性规划无缝对齐，把拟阵接进组合优化主干。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读-跨链接\">延伸阅读 / 跨链接</h2><ul>\n<li>贪心最优性所依赖的交换公理：<a href=\"../foundations/independence-axioms\">独立性公理</a></li>\n<li>oracle 与秩增量的 0/1 性质：<a href=\"../structure/rank-closure\">秩与闭包</a></li>\n<li>两个拟阵下贪心失效、需增广算法：<a href=\"matroid-intersection\">拟阵交</a></li>\n<li>拟阵在真实系统中的落地与边界：<a href=\"matroid-theory-in-practice\">应用与边界</a></li>\n<li>Kruskal 的具体实现：<a href=\"../../graph-theory/algorithms/mst-topological-sort\">图论 · 最小生成树与拓扑排序</a></li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"贪心与优化：拟阵恰好刻画「贪心何时最优」","id":"贪心与优化-拟阵恰好刻画-贪心何时最优"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：赋权拟阵上的贪心","id":"核心概念-赋权拟阵上的贪心"},{"level":2,"text":"Rado-Edmonds 定理","id":"rado-edmonds-定理"},{"level":2,"text":"Kruskal 只是一个特例","id":"kruskal-只是一个特例"},{"level":2,"text":"复杂度与 oracle 模型","id":"复杂度与-oracle-模型"},{"level":2,"text":"从最大权到多面体：拟阵与线性规划","id":"从最大权到多面体-拟阵与线性规划"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读 / 跨链接","id":"延伸阅读-跨链接"}],"prev":{"title":"可表示性：哪些抽象拟阵真能落回矩阵","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/matroid-theory/operations/representability"},"next":{"title":"拟阵交：一个拟阵易、两个拟阵妙、三个拟阵难","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/matroid-theory/practice/matroid-intersection"}}